  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Platos is a monitoring platform for holistic chronic disease care. Platosempowers patients and clinicians to monitor holistic health while enablingdata-driven, personalised and proactive care from anywhere. Platos virtualclinic was launched in Nigeria in November 2020 and has directly cared formore than 300 patients with strong outcomes. Another 1300+ patients haveused Platos to monitor their health while working with 3rd party medicalteams from clinics and hospitals around Nigeria.</narrative>
